  "description": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE – VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTHREE BEDROOM HOUSE IN DUBLIN 5\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRay Cooke Lettings proudly presents this bright, spacious and recently renovated three‑bedroom house, superbly positioned on the ever‑popular Ardbeg Road in Artane, Dublin 5.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe property features a welcoming entrance hallway, a comfortable living room, a light‑filled kitchen/dining area, two bedrooms and a main bathroom. In addition, the home includes a self‑contained unit/ garden room with a W.C, kitchenette — ideal for storage, a home workspace, or parking.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nArdbeg Road enjoys an exceptional location with a wealth of amenities nearby, including shops, cafés, restaurants, gyms and leisure clubs. Artane Castle Shopping Centre is within easy reach, while St. Anne’s Park and Dollymount Strand offer superb outdoor recreation. There is an excellent choice of primary and secondary schools, childcare facilities and a close proximity to Beaumont Hospital.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTransport links are second to none. Killester and Harmonstown DART stations are both within walking distance, and numerous bus routes operate along the Malahide Road and Ardlea Road. The M1, M50, Dublin Airport, East Point Business Park, IFSC and Dublin City Centre are all easily accessible.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nRecently renovated\r\n\r\nThree bedrooms\r\n\r\nClose walk to public transport\r\n\r\nLOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION\r\n\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE",
